/-! # Herbrand.HerbrandTheorem.Main
    Formalization of Chapter 7, Section 5.4: Herbrand's Theorem
    for prenex formulae.

    Covers Theorem 7.5.1 (Herbrand's theorem) and Example 7.5.3
